{"id":"612108","name":"韩式辣泡饭","author":"polaris滴食记","authorId":"10301589","desc":"","cover":"images/612108/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"杏鲍菇","amount":"100克"},{"name":"杂粮米饭","amount":"100克"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"（干）4朵"},{"name":"紫菜","amount":"10克"},{"name":"卷心菜","amount":"200克"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"500毫升"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材：卷心菜洗净切丝，香菇泡发后切丝，杏鲍菇切丝。","img":"images/612108/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅底铺上卷心菜丝。","img":"images/612108/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"铺上泡发后的香菇丝。","img":"images/612108/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入杏鲍菇丝。","img":"images/612108/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入100克杂粮米饭。","img":"images/612108/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入500毫升清水。","img":"images/612108/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入1勺韩式辣椒酱。","img":"images/612108/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将酱料搅拌均匀。","img":"images/612108/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大火煮开后，炖煮5分钟。","img":"images/612108/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入紫菜之后，炖煮1分钟即可关火。","img":"images/612108/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"最后淋上亚麻籽油。","img":"images/612108/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"来上一碗暖乎乎的辣泡饭。","img":"images/612108/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"亚麻籽油不耐高温，建议关火之后再淋上，可以保留营养元素的最大化。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}